# Charger Port — photo selection manifest
# Format:  SOURCE   target.webp      (# comments + blank lines ignored)
# Convert with (any OS — needs `pip install pillow pillow-heif`):
#   MIN_PX=900 python3 tools/convert_build_photos.py <staging-dir> docs/assets/build/charger-port/photos.manifest docs/assets/build/charger-port
# MIN_PX=900 is needed for the whole-frame shot only — a full-frame carpet
# background busts the 300 KB budget even at the default 1200 px floor.
#
# Source: the "3 - Fan and Charge Port Install" Drive folder, which covers BOTH
# this module and cooling-fan/. Sources 4-6 are this module's install sequence;
# 1-3 are the fan. The "*Done" shots are the finished states.
#
# "BothDone.jpg" shows the two panels fitted together, so it is converted into
# each module's folder under a name that suits that page — the duplicate keeps
# each folder self-contained.

4.jpeg                  01-panel-before-slide-in.webp
5.jpeg                  02-panel-slid-in.webp
6.jpeg                  03-tightening-the-panel.webp
ChargerBackDone.jpeg    04-connector-rear.webp
ChargerDone.jpg         05-charge-port-installed.webp
BothDone.jpg            06-both-panels-in-frame.webp
